cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "calion: District Heating Dispatch Optimization Framework"
abstract: >
  Code and configuration package for 'Loss Visibility versus Spatial Detail in
  industrial District-Heating Dispatch Optimisation' (Applied Energy,
  APEN-D-26-15734R1). Model levels from a loss-blind copperplate to a nonlinear
  reference are implemented in Pyomo/Gurobi. This minimal release contains the
  calion framework together with the Memmingen primary-case and 135-network
  synthetic configurations. Raw operational data for the primary case (non-disclosure
  agreement) and the manuscript text are not included.
